sequenceDiagram
    accTitle: A first protected request
    accDescr: A pending proxy connection leads to a user decision, a scoped signing request, and the site's authenticated response.
    participant W as Workload
    participant G as Gateway
    participant B as Broker
    participant C as Companion
    participant S as Site
    W->>G: CONNECT
    G->>B: Bind job and host
    B-->>C: Notify with ID
    C->>B: Fetch offer
    Note over C: User picks a certificate and duration
    C->>B: Approve and send chain
    B->>C: Activate grant
    C-->>B: Ready
    G->>B: Look up grant and acquire leases
    G->>S: Begin upstream TLS
    S-->>G: Server proof and client certificate request
    Note over G: Verify server
    G->>B: Request signature
    B->>C: Sign handshake
    C-->>B: Native signature
    B-->>G: Verified signature
    G->>S: Finish mTLS and send HTTP request
    S-->>G: HTTP response
    G-->>W: HTTP response
